      "text": "6/ On compute—we have seen the astronomical investment into GPUs with NVIDIA's revenue growth. Staggering.\n\nNow the bottleneck is going to be—\n- how many more chips can we make\n- where will they go\n- where will the power come from\n- how tightly can we interconnect them https://t.co/0tZbd7u510",
