        "text": "2/ I grew up in Los Alamos, New Mexico, a place with a very deep history.\n\nZach Bryan is one of the great modern American storytellers, and my own favorite artist.\n\nWhen he told me about his own passion for history, and his desire to build something new, I knew we had to team up."
